{"id":3813,"title":{"romaji":"Spriggan","english":"SPRIGGAN (ONA)","native":"スプリガン (ONA)"},"slug":"spriggan_2022","synopsis":"Deep in the Ararat Mountains of Turkey, a secret organization known as ARCAM has found what is believed to be Noah's Ark. However, the U.S. Machine Corps., a rogue organization of the Pentagon, wants to take over the Ark as a means of global supremacy. Only a special ARCAM operative known as a Spriggan stands in their way. Japanese Spriggan Yu Ominae teams up with French Spriggan Jean-Jacques Mondo to combat members of the U.S. Machine Corps. led by Col. MacDougall—a genetically-enhanced boy with deadly psionic powers. However, they must act fast and stop MacDougall before he uses the Ark for his own agenda.\r\n\r\n(Source: ANN)","format":"ONA","season":"SPRING","year":2022,"createdAt":"2022-06-21 15:30:51","updatedAt":"2022-06-21 15:30:51","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":39489},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42797},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":108353},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14734},{"site":"ANN","externalId":24363},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":103},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":81050064},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":9245,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/tbVe0gr8EC1aAwOq7TX1vyQz7kOsSpu4stdqnnZW.jpg"},{"id":9246,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/Vwe2ryPvaOKvueHmTFoqlDO7c3U8ZdROB1YiC4pA.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":7,"name":"David Production","slug":"david_production"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":11556,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11557,"title":{"romaji":"Seeking the Truth feat. YAHZARAH","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":13432,"version":1,"episodes":"1-6","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":15660,"basename":"Spriggan2022-OP1.webm","filename":"Spriggan2022-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Spriggan2022-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","